isomd5sum
*********

This manual describes the isomd5sum tools for implanting and verifying
MD5 and SHA-256 checksums in ISO 9660 images.

* Menu:

* Introduction::          Overview and concepts.
* implantisomd5::         Implant an MD5 checksum.
* checkisomd5::           Verify an MD5 checksum.
* implantisosha::         Implant a SHA-256 checksum.
* checkisosha::           Verify a SHA-256 or MD5 checksum.
* Examples::              Common usage examples.
* Reporting Bugs::        How to report problems.
* Index::                 Concept index.


