7 Reporting Bugs
****************

Please report bugs and feature requests at:

   <https://github.com/rhinstaller/isomd5sum/issues>

   You may also send mail to the Anaconda development mailing list:
<anaconda-devel-list@redhat.com>

   When reporting a bug, please include:

   • The version of isomd5sum (‘checkisomd5 --version’ or the package
     version).
   • The operating system and distribution.
   • The command line you used and the full output.
   • If applicable, information about the ISO file (how it was created,
     its size, and whether it was created with another isomd5sum
     version).


